msgid "Dynamic content opens what it needs"
msgstr "Dynamische inhoud opent wat nodig is"

#: includes/admin/class-bolt-edit-admin-get-started.php:163
msgid "Products, posts and other managed content get a gray outline. Popular dynamic content plugins open their edit screen in the popup, scrolled to the field you clicked and outlined. Their role decides what they may edit: WooCommerce products need the Shop manager role."
